Package: freedomnas-module-proxy
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, freedomnas-core (>> 0.9.12), freedomnas-webui (>> 0.9.12), caddy, lego
Description: Reverse proxy for FreedomNAS: HTTPS for every web app
 FreedomNAS community module that puts Caddy in front of the NAS's web
 apps, serving each over HTTPS on its own port with FreedomNAS's own
 certificate.
 .
 Ships modules/proxy/ and profiles/proxy/ under /usr/lib/freedomnas/.
